{"id":"wb-8-452","name":"海口川字闸","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"海口川字闸","text":"海口川字闸位于云南省昆明市西山区海口街道海门社区中滩村的海口河上，地处滇池出水口，是桥闸结合的多孔石拱桥。海口川字闸原名屡丰闸，又称白鹤梁、白鹤桥，建于清道光十六年（1836年），由北闸、中闸与南闸三部分组成，分跨于三股河道之上，因形如“川”字而得名。该闸在古代兼具蓄水、泄洪、灌溉及通行功能。2019年，海口川字闸被列为第八批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B5%B7%E5%8F%A3%E5%B7%9D%E5%AD%97%E9%97%B8","revisionId":91261927,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91261927","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/17836fdb52b4495ba31db0d5.jpg","title":"海口川字闸-南闸_2025-08-06_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%B5%B7%E5%8F%A3%E5%B7%9D%E5%AD%97%E9%97%B8-%E5%8D%97%E9%97%B8_2025-08-06_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/eb/%E6%B5%B7%E5%8F%A3%E5%B7%9D%E5%AD%97%E9%97%B8-%E5%8D%97%E9%97%B8_2025-08-06_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Kcx36","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​海口川字闸","width":320,"height":213}}